{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coincidences?</strong>\u00a0is a linear first\u2011person psychological horror walking simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/extras/74e775b715d67ec7957931bc6f1392c7.poster.avif?t=1768540213\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/extras/74e775b715d67ec7957931bc6f1392c7.webm?t=1768540213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/extras/74e775b715d67ec7957931bc6f1392c7.mp4?t=1768540213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live an ordinary life until your landlord suddenly raises the rent. In search of the cheapest housing you rent a suspiciously cheap house on the edge of the forest and take a job as a cashier at the only store nearby. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the house and talk to the locals it becomes clear that something bad is happening here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest wilderness atmosphere.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on the forest setting and an old house: sounds, lighting and surroundings create total immersion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interaction with NPCs.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you will interact with the locals, giving you a deeper understanding of what is happening.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First\u2011person cutscenes.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short first\u2011person cutscenes enhance the character\u2019s perspective and the atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No puzzles.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex tasks: just follow the story and complete simple objectives.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Approximate playtime ~50 minutes (demo 13\u201315 minutes)</u></i></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848750?t=1768540213","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/5e1706634ef12117319f6a6b1d8c6f0700973bc4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768540213","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/9b1921fa54f60cf4075f8b749d1cb1e5f30ee39e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768540213","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/9b1921fa54f60cf4075f8b749d1cb1e5f30ee39e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768540213","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Occasional graphic gore/dismemberment in later scenes; brief self-harm reference"},"demos":[{"appid":3918750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coincidences?</strong>\u00a0is a linear first\u2011person psychological horror walking simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/extras/74e775b715d67ec7957931bc6f1392c7.poster.avif?t=1768540213\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/extras/74e775b715d67ec7957931bc6f1392c7.webm?t=1768540213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/extras/74e775b715d67ec7957931bc6f1392c7.mp4?t=1768540213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live an ordinary life until your landlord suddenly raises the rent. In search of the cheapest housing you rent a suspiciously cheap house on the edge of the forest and take a job as a cashier at the only store nearby. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the house and talk to the locals it becomes clear that something bad is happening here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest wilderness atmosphere.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on the forest setting and an old house: sounds, lighting and surroundings create total immersion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interaction with NPCs.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you will interact with the locals, giving you a deeper understanding of what is happening.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First\u2011person cutscenes.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short first\u2011person cutscenes enhance the character\u2019s perspective and the atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No puzzles.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex tasks: just follow the story and complete simple objectives.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Approximate playtime ~50 minutes (demo 13\u201315 minutes)</u></i></h2>","developers":["FogTime"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/c5f380927df70a9739d4ec434df60f876eb2dab3/header.jpg?t=1768540213","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br>